02:02.430 --> 02:05.890
Um... Misaki-san, where are we going?

02:05.890 --> 02:08.310
You want to know where Kotone-chan went, right?

02:08.980 --> 02:12.730
Don't worry, I'll definitely find her for you.

02:15.280 --> 02:16.360
In here.

02:17.240 --> 02:18.030
This is...!

02:20.870 --> 02:21.820
See?

02:21.820 --> 02:25.490
The whole mountain is surveyed from this monitoring room.

02:26.160 --> 02:28.460
You see, the mountain is too large.

02:28.460 --> 02:32.460
A single person can't oversee
such a huge area alone.

02:32.460 --> 02:36.420
I'm not boasting, but you won't find this kind of tech {facility}anywhere else.

02:38.130 --> 02:39.970
Hey, are you listening?

02:41.220 --> 02:44.260
Misaki-san, what are those red dots?

02:44.640 --> 02:45.930
Ah, those.

02:46.350 --> 02:51.400
Sensors throughout the mountain detect humans and display their positions.

02:51.400 --> 02:54.230
By the way, this is where we are right now.

02:56.690 --> 02:58.780
It even records all the image data.

02:59.110 --> 03:01.530
Amazing! It can do even that!

03:02.160 --> 03:03.450
Do you want to see?

03:03.450 --> 03:05.200
Doesn't have to be from today either.

03:05.490 --> 03:06.830
Really?

03:06.830 --> 03:11.330
Well, let's see... Three nights ago...

03:11.330 --> 03:13.130
An image from around here...

03:16.800 --> 03:17.760
Weird.

03:17.760 --> 03:19.130
Just now, for a moment...

03:20.130 --> 03:23.090
Ah, this dot in a far off place

03:23.090 --> 03:24.850
must be Kotone-chan!

03:25.850 --> 03:28.930
It's possible. Let's have a look at the images from that place.

03:31.940 --> 03:34.310
That's a pretty familiar silhouette.

03:34.310 --> 03:37.150
But, it's hard to recognize it.

03:37.150 --> 03:39.530
Let's pull up shots from other angles.

03:40.780 --> 03:41.780
What the hell?

03:41.780 --> 03:43.780
It's so blurry!

03:43.780 --> 03:46.700
It does look a little like Kotone-chan.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.410
Weird.

03:48.410 --> 03:51.370
This was supposed to be shot by a high-speed camera.

03:52.920 --> 03:56.920
<i>Her feral instincts must've kept her from being captured on film.</i>

03:56.920 --> 03:58.920
<i>Kotone-chan is really going all out.</i>

04:01.340 --> 04:03.010
T-That's...

04:03.010 --> 04:03.800
Huh?

04:03.800 --> 04:06.300
There's something else nearby.

04:06.300 --> 04:07.930
Could it be...?

04:09.720 --> 04:11.640
It really is Mishimaki-sensei!

04:11.640 --> 04:15.770
Amazing. I've never seen the coach
look so concerned.

04:15.770 --> 04:19.940
He probably chased after Kotone when he found out about her.

04:19.940 --> 04:21.860
That's good.

04:21.860 --> 04:27.240
Well, everyone can calm down now, so let's have breakfast.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.910
We'll practice afterwards.

04:28.910 --> 04:30.080
Yeah.

04:30.080 --> 04:34.170
Seriously, to make us worry like this...

04:41.010 --> 04:42.630
Eli-chan, let's go.

04:43.260 --> 04:44.340
Yes!

04:48.220 --> 04:49.050
Damn it!

04:49.640 --> 04:54.520
You didn't have to fondle right in front of me!

04:54.520 --> 04:58.730
If it's like that, I might as well train nonstop while hiding in the mountains!

04:59.270 --> 05:03.070
Whatever. They'll be sure to get along great now that I left.

05:03.070 --> 05:06.160
Maybe they'll even go into Mishi's room...

05:06.160 --> 05:08.700
And then... And then...

05:11.160 --> 05:11.910
Love.

05:12.290 --> 05:13.500
Heartbeat!

05:15.870 --> 05:19.630
No!

05:19.880 --> 05:23.210
Oh, no! Shit!

05:29.140 --> 05:30.470
Mishi...

05:30.680 --> 05:33.390
Man! What are you doing?!

05:33.390 --> 05:35.560
Stop worrying everyone so much!

05:35.560 --> 05:38.480
Don't let go, got it?

05:39.860 --> 05:41.400
I'll think of a way...

05:43.780 --> 05:49.240
You better think of a way!

05:51.830 --> 05:55.410
L-Listen up, definitely don't let go.

05:57.370 --> 05:58.540
I don't wanna!

05:58.540 --> 06:00.630
Don't wanna, don't wanna, don't wanna, don't wanna!{no no no no!}{I'M PREDICTING A NEW SNSD SONG TITLED "NO"}

06:00.630 --> 06:03.380
Seriously, you're annoying.

06:03.380 --> 06:06.420
I already said I'll be leaving.

06:06.420 --> 06:09.510
Won't it be embarrassing if I go back now?

06:09.510 --> 06:11.640
Isn't a one-day trip a vacation as well?

06:11.640 --> 06:14.430
Stop talking! Let me go!

06:14.430 --> 06:15.390
Kotone?

06:16.180 --> 06:20.480
Mishi... Mishi, you don't have to mind me at all!

06:20.480 --> 06:22.570
Just go have fun with Eli!

06:25.190 --> 06:27.240
Have fun with Eli...

06:27.240 --> 06:30.410
Could it be... Did you see everything yesterday?{DUDE, NOT THE RIGHT THING TO SAY}

06:31.990 --> 06:34.410
I see, that's why...

06:35.200 --> 06:38.290
But, if you want it badly,
I can give it to you if you ask.

06:39.290 --> 06:40.500
I understand, Kotone.

06:40.750 --> 06:43.460
Then I'll let you experience the spice of an adult.

06:43.460 --> 06:45.420
Although the stimulation might be too much.

06:45.420 --> 06:47.300
W-Wait a minute, Mishi!

06:47.300 --> 06:49.010
I might want it a lot,

06:49.010 --> 06:52.600
but I haven't yet sorted out my emotions.

06:54.350 --> 06:55.600
<b>Peach Cider</b>

06:54.350 --> 06:55.600
<b>Habanero Chili</b>

06:56.060 --> 06:56.850
Huh?

06:57.930 --> 07:01.350
I didn't think you'd like HabaPe soda too.

07:01.350 --> 07:03.730
You're pretty high maintenance.

07:03.730 --> 07:04.520
Huh?

07:11.950 --> 07:12.820
What?

07:13.120 --> 07:14.990
I was thinking,

07:14.990 --> 07:18.380
yesterday you weren't wearing anything under your yukata.

07:20.960 --> 07:22.370
Isn't that how it's normally done?

07:22.630 --> 07:27.210
I heard people didn't wear anything under traditional clothes in the past,

07:27.800 --> 07:30.510
but not wearing anything while in a yukata is a bit...

07:32.050 --> 07:35.470
I got it! It's because yesterday was humid!

07:35.470 --> 07:38.430
Right! R-R-R-Right!

07:38.430 --> 07:41.350
I understood it with just
a bit of thinking now, didn't I?

07:41.350 --> 07:45.270
I-I don't do well with humidity, so I wasn't wearing anything by mistake!

07:45.690 --> 07:48.650
<i>S-Saved. How close...</i>

07:48.690 --> 07:51.650
<b>By the way, here's how she sleeps.</b>

07:51.650 --> 07:53.780
No!

07:53.780 --> 07:57.200
The wall over there smiled at me!

07:57.200 --> 07:58.620
How's that even possible?

07:58.620 --> 08:00.500
Just an illusion, an illusion.

08:00.500 --> 08:02.210
It was definitely smiling!

08:03.620 --> 08:07.460
Anyway, why do we have to go through this cave?

08:07.460 --> 08:10.460
It looked faster.

08:10.460 --> 08:13.470
We ended up absolutely lost anyway, didn't we?!

08:16.010 --> 08:17.680
It's all over!

08:17.680 --> 08:21.640
We're gonna get butchered by the evil spirits in this cave!

08:21.640 --> 08:22.640
Don't!

08:22.640 --> 08:22.770
Placeholder

08:22.640 --> 08:23.440
Save me!

08:22.770 --> 08:26.070
What a troublesome princess.

08:23.440 --> 08:26.070
No no no no no!

08:32.360 --> 08:34.030
Mishi, what are you doing?

08:34.030 --> 08:36.200
Aren't you afraid of the walls?

08:37.530 --> 08:40.290
Just look at me all the time.

08:40.290 --> 08:43.750
That way you won't see useless stuff, will you?

08:45.080 --> 08:50.170
Mm, looking at you... <i>all the time...</i>

08:51.260 --> 08:54.380
Huh, you're surprisingly heavy.

08:54.380 --> 08:57.300
I-It's muscles, idiot!

09:02.890 --> 09:08.020
All right. We'll let Mishimaki-sensei take care of Kotone-chan.

09:08.020 --> 09:10.860
Let's have a bit of light practice.

09:11.110 --> 09:12.190
Yes!

09:12.190 --> 09:13.650
Wait a minute!

09:14.820 --> 09:16.410
What is it, Sumino-chan?

09:16.410 --> 09:19.280
Don't mention easy stuff like light practice.

09:19.280 --> 09:23.250
How about an all-out match, national champion?

09:23.540 --> 09:26.540
What? You want revenge for yesterday?

09:27.420 --> 09:31.380
I can't have you looking down on me because of those games.

09:31.630 --> 09:36.050
Not that I care, but you'll regret this.

09:47.520 --> 09:49.230
<i>Not bad indeed.</i>

09:49.230 --> 09:52.730
<i>But, she hasn't yet laid her cards on the table.</i>

09:52.730 --> 09:54.440
<i>Show me...</i>

09:55.900 --> 09:58.820
how strong a national champion is!

09:59.240 --> 10:03.830
That's the ultimate trump card Sumino kept hidden for a real tournament!

10:03.830 --> 10:06.460
Sure-kill: Moratorium Jet Fire!

10:06.460 --> 10:08.000
Sure-kill?

10:08.000 --> 10:13.380
If you dare call it "sure-kill," then it has to take out the opponent one hundred percent of the time.

10:13.380 --> 10:14.760
Like this:

10:16.340 --> 10:19.220
Sure-kill: Invisible Counter!

10:19.220 --> 10:20.140
She returned it!

10:20.140 --> 10:21.800
No, what really matters...

10:23.970 --> 10:26.020
The ball disappeared?!

10:26.020 --> 10:28.690
N-No way! What sort of trick is this?!

10:29.140 --> 10:30.560
Damn it, what is it?

10:30.560 --> 10:32.820
A cross? Or a spinning straight?

10:35.690 --> 10:38.360
<i>I-It was actually a direct hit!</i>

10:39.990 --> 10:42.570
Sumino-chan!

10:42.570 --> 10:44.950
It's not a trick.

10:44.950 --> 10:48.790
I just hit the ball so hard that the impact makes it fly slightly above light speed.

10:48.790 --> 10:51.840
That's why it seems invisible to normal eyes.

10:52.290 --> 10:56.210
Didn't I tell her she'll regret this?

10:56.210 --> 10:59.880
<i>S-She actually sent the opponent flying with her hit.</i>

10:59.880 --> 11:02.390
<i>The fearsome Invisible Counter.</i>

11:02.390 --> 11:05.720
<i>What we should talk about is the frightening power...</i>

11:08.140 --> 11:09.520
Invisible Counter.

11:12.230 --> 11:14.070
Damn! I'll avenge Sumino!

11:14.310 --> 11:16.320
Ten People, Ten Colors Strike!{Thingy!}

11:17.280 --> 11:19.740
Amamiya Style, Flower of the Sixteenth Night!

11:20.030 --> 11:22.820
Forbidden Shot, Paparazzi Requiem!

11:25.870 --> 11:26.910
Farewell!

11:26.910 --> 11:28.450
Have a nice day!

11:28.500 --> 11:31.000
<b>Akadama Middle, Second Year:</b>

11:29.120 --> 11:31.000
<b>Tsuchita Sachiko (14)</b>

11:31.250 --> 11:34.630
Okay. Seems like the Akadama people have been cleared out.

11:36.300 --> 11:37.590
That's right.

11:37.340 --> 11:39.840
<b>Akadama Middle, Second Year:</b>

11:37.960 --> 11:39.840
<b>Tsuchita Sachiko (14)</b>

11:40.010 --> 11:42.050
Have a nice day!

11:42.050 --> 11:44.850
Huh? Someone flew by again.

11:44.850 --> 11:47.890
Are they having some sort of human cannon contest?

11:47.890 --> 11:51.020
No idea. I didn't hear about it.

11:51.020 --> 11:52.390
Forget it.

11:52.390 --> 11:55.270
What's important now is tennis.

11:55.270 --> 11:59.230
I'm going to let everyone see
how much I've powered up.

11:59.230 --> 12:02.820
Let everyone see... But did you
do any special training?

12:02.820 --> 12:04.700
How have you powered up?

12:08.080 --> 12:09.490
Right here.

12:11.330 --> 12:15.670
Really? I don't see any power going up.

12:15.670 --> 12:17.090
What?

12:17.090 --> 12:18.330
I'm talking about the inside! Inside!

12:21.880 --> 12:25.260
Are you guys still not ready?

12:25.970 --> 12:29.060
Weird, we keep getting a tie.

12:34.850 --> 12:37.310
Get ready quickly.

12:37.310 --> 12:41.110
Your fate is to be sent flying anyway, so just come in whatever order.

12:41.110 --> 12:43.740
F-Fate can be changed!

12:43.740 --> 12:46.110
Show it to me with your skills!

12:46.620 --> 12:48.240
Did you hear her?

12:48.240 --> 12:52.370
We've stalled as much as we could. What do we do?

12:52.370 --> 12:56.120
Misaki-san seems a little impatient.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.540
There's no other way.

12:59.170 --> 13:01.340
As the Club President, I will go first!

13:01.340 --> 13:02.130
Chitose-san!

13:02.130 --> 13:05.340
No, I have the least experience. I should go!

13:05.340 --> 13:06.550
Eli-san too!

13:06.550 --> 13:08.800
I'm the youngest seed anyway.

13:08.800 --> 13:10.390
Even Kurusu-chan!

13:10.390 --> 13:12.430
I-If that's how it is, I can't stay back!

13:12.770 --> 13:14.310
Please let me go first!

13:14.310 --> 13:15.850
Go ahead, go ahead.{LOLOLOL GOT TROLLED}

13:16.310 --> 13:19.020
Damn it, they got me!

13:19.020 --> 13:20.980
Are you done yet? Come faster.

13:23.570 --> 13:28.200
I'm so scared... How many miles will I fly?

13:29.160 --> 13:31.660
If I'm unlucky, I might even die.

13:31.660 --> 13:33.910
Why do you have to say such things?{lol another Eva reference !! }

13:34.660 --> 13:35.870
Kurusu-chan.

13:36.870 --> 13:38.330
You won't die.

13:40.380 --> 13:42.000
I'll protect you.

13:43.880 --> 13:46.800
Are you going to fight alongside me?!

13:48.550 --> 13:49.720
Yay!

13:50.140 --> 13:53.180
If Kurusu-chan is here, I'm saved!

13:53.180 --> 13:58.940
<i>K-K-Kurusu-sama, are you abandoning me?!</i>

14:01.150 --> 14:03.570
First, you must have confidence.

14:03.570 --> 14:06.530
Even if you say so... She's just too strong!

14:06.820 --> 14:07.820
Don't worry.

14:07.820 --> 14:10.990
The barricade in your heart can be broken from the outside.

14:16.080 --> 14:18.120
Come on.

14:19.580 --> 14:22.130
Worldwide Jealousy Makeup.

14:22.670 --> 14:24.630
Is this me?

14:24.630 --> 14:28.380
I feel like I could seduce the masses!

14:28.380 --> 14:30.510
Mm, that's the mood.

14:32.220 --> 14:35.060
Sure-kill, Asience Moisture!{Asience is a shampoo/moisturizer. they got nice commercials, slap one of them in the release post ;)}

14:35.600 --> 14:38.440
<i>Just putting on that makeup made her much more agile.</i>

14:39.440 --> 14:41.810
<i>She seems to be controlled by her fantasies.</i>

14:41.810 --> 14:43.650
<i>Is this the so-called placebo effect?</i>

14:45.030 --> 14:47.240
<i>I noticed during warming up.</i>

14:47.240 --> 14:50.950
<i>These people are hard to get a grip on.</i>

14:50.950 --> 14:51.910
<i>Even so...</i>

14:52.820 --> 14:55.200
I'm still far better!

14:56.700 --> 14:58.500
Asuna-chan!

14:59.290 --> 15:01.210
Are you all right?!

15:01.210 --> 15:02.130
Wake up!

15:10.050 --> 15:16.100
K-Kurusu-chan, should I open my legs even wider?

15:16.970 --> 15:18.390
Like this?

15:18.390 --> 15:20.270
If you overdo it, you'll look slutty.

15:20.270 --> 15:22.060
I s-see.

15:22.060 --> 15:24.870
Good. You seem to be full of energy.

15:27.440 --> 15:30.320
Kurusu-chan, no matter how confident I am,

15:30.320 --> 15:32.410
I still can't overcome this opponent.

15:32.410 --> 15:34.410
Is there no way out?

15:34.410 --> 15:35.450
There's no other way.

15:35.450 --> 15:36.490
We must use our sure-kill.

15:36.740 --> 15:37.910
We got one?

15:37.910 --> 15:41.750
Abandon hope! No one can escape from my Invisible Counter!

15:44.500 --> 15:46.250
Hokkaido San.

15:46.250 --> 15:47.750
A giant salamander?!

15:50.090 --> 15:53.840
<i>If I hurt the giant salamander, I'll violate the endangered animals laws,</i>

15:53.840 --> 15:55.850
<i>and become a juvenile delinquent!</i>

15:56.390 --> 15:58.010
That's our Kurusu-chan!

15:58.010 --> 16:00.520
Now she won't have to worry about being hi...

16:00.520 --> 16:04.600
<i>Huh? If the target isn't Kurusu, that leaves...</i>

16:04.650 --> 16:05.940
Elimination.

16:07.440 --> 16:09.860
Thought so!

16:09.860 --> 16:11.360
Asuna-chan!

16:11.360 --> 16:14.360
That is what happened to Akadama!

16:19.450 --> 16:20.620
I see.

16:22.750 --> 16:25.130
I was wondering why people keep flying around.

16:25.130 --> 16:26.840
So this is what's going on.

16:26.840 --> 16:28.340
Kotone-chan!

16:28.340 --> 16:29.090
Mishi!

16:29.090 --> 16:31.380
But that will end now!

16:38.260 --> 16:43.190
I'll stop you. <i>But...</i>

16:43.690 --> 16:45.690
G-G-Give me another ten minutes.

16:48.980 --> 16:52.400
Anyway, is she really that powerful?

16:52.400 --> 16:54.400
She's on another level altogether.

16:54.400 --> 16:57.490
Then if I fight her...

16:57.490 --> 16:58.990
Instant kill.

16:58.990 --> 16:59.740
That so?

16:59.740 --> 17:01.450
Instant kill...

17:01.450 --> 17:03.460
Nothing about it then.

17:03.460 --> 17:06.000
We'll play doubles against her for now.

