17:13.840 --> 17:17.220
Then it's up to... you, Eli.

17:17.220 --> 17:18.260
Yes!

17:20.180 --> 17:21.100
Watch this!

17:22.310 --> 17:25.020
Did Kotone-chan power-up?

17:25.020 --> 17:29.110
She didn't. She's just more excited than usual.

17:29.110 --> 17:33.110
Maybe getting in touch with
nature worked for her.

17:33.110 --> 17:37.200
<i>T-Touched by nature?!</i>

17:37.780 --> 17:41.160
That would definitely excite someone!

17:41.160 --> 17:43.540
I estimate it won't last long.

17:43.540 --> 17:45.290
It's only temporary.

17:47.750 --> 17:50.290
A magic ball that can disappear?

17:50.290 --> 17:54.420
But isn't it just a straight in the end?

17:54.420 --> 17:55.300
Yes.

17:55.300 --> 17:57.880
Then there's a way to counter it.

17:58.890 --> 18:04.930
Um... I have always wondered about something.

18:04.930 --> 18:06.520
What is it? Let's hear it.

18:09.600 --> 18:13.110
Kotone... do you like Mishi?

18:18.320 --> 18:21.120
W-Why'd you ask this kind of weird question out of the blue?!

18:21.120 --> 18:24.490
If you don't concentrate on the game, we'll lose!

18:40.220 --> 18:41.180
Eli-chan!

18:41.890 --> 18:43.510
Hey, are you all right?!

18:43.510 --> 18:44.810
Pull yourself together, Eli!

18:44.810 --> 18:46.140
I...

18:48.060 --> 18:52.270
I like Mishi.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.570
I love him!

18:54.730 --> 19:01.320
<i>Seriously... She really got me with an absolute, total straight ball!</i>

19:01.320 --> 19:02.410
<i>Then...</i>

19:02.410 --> 19:05.040
<i>I must hit a straight back too!</i>

19:05.040 --> 19:08.580
I-I l-l-like... love too...

19:08.580 --> 19:10.920
No-Not a bit less than you!

19:10.920 --> 19:13.460
T-To Mishi, I'm...

19:14.790 --> 19:17.010
Like—

19:21.260 --> 19:24.510
Ah, Kotone-chan!

19:24.510 --> 19:26.560
<i>Thanks, Kotone.</i>

19:28.430 --> 19:30.850
Work hard, Chitose-san!

19:30.850 --> 19:32.310
Save your energy!

19:33.770 --> 19:37.150
Don't worry, this time I have a strategy.

19:37.150 --> 19:40.070
That's why I'll definitely get a point—

19:41.110 --> 19:42.950
She got blown away right after speaking!

19:42.950 --> 19:44.450
Chitose-san!

19:44.450 --> 19:49.160
How can you look around while fighting me?

19:55.130 --> 19:58.770
No way! She actually caught the ball with her teeth!

19:59.550 --> 20:03.180
Could it be that Chitose-san can see the ball?

20:03.180 --> 20:06.260
No. I'll clue you in.

20:06.600 --> 20:12.560
She might have hypnotized herself like this: "The ball is a daifuku bun, the ball is a daifuku bun."

20:12.560 --> 20:15.610
Then she just let her gourmet instincts take care of the rest.

20:15.610 --> 20:17.650
C-Can that even be done?

20:17.650 --> 20:18.690
Watch.

20:18.690 --> 20:19.780
There's your evidence.

20:20.070 --> 20:21.560
She's chewing.

20:22.150 --> 20:24.780
She's really chewing.

20:24.780 --> 20:26.530
She's chewing.

20:26.530 --> 20:27.910
Unsightly.

20:31.540 --> 20:34.500
How long is she going to keep eating them?

20:34.500 --> 20:36.420
She should play like a normal—

20:44.090 --> 20:46.560
S-She got a point.

20:47.470 --> 20:49.760
A point, Chitose-san!

20:49.760 --> 20:53.440
She really got a point from Misaki-san!

20:54.100 --> 20:57.400
Lets play tennis... please.

20:57.940 --> 21:01.400
Thank you for the past three days.

21:01.610 --> 21:03.400
Be careful on the way back.

21:03.400 --> 21:08.280
Don't worry, that bear guy will bring us back.

21:09.780 --> 21:12.290
I-I see, I'm relieved.

21:12.870 --> 21:15.330
Then see you on the battlefield next time.

21:15.330 --> 21:18.250
Before that, you must all become better.

21:18.250 --> 21:22.760
Okay. Next time we'll get a point from you through real stren—

21:22.760 --> 21:25.550
Why are you being so halfheartedly?

21:25.550 --> 21:26.800
Kotone-chan.

21:26.800 --> 21:29.300
It should be, "We'll win the next time!"

21:30.430 --> 21:34.600
Right. The challenger needs to be fired up like this.

21:34.600 --> 21:37.060
Otherwise, it isn't even worth crushing you.

21:37.060 --> 21:39.110
All of you work hard!

21:39.110 --> 21:40.730
That's what you're saying now?!

21:40.730 --> 21:42.780
I'll definitely cut you down to size on the tournament court!

21:43.320 --> 21:45.200
Bye!

21:45.950 --> 21:49.950
<i>And like that our camp ended.</i>

21:49.950 --> 21:52.700
<i>We'll find out in the upcoming tournament</i>

21:52.700 --> 21:57.040
<i>how much we have grown in these three days.</i>

21:57.370 --> 22:00.380
Win against me the next time we meet?

22:00.380 --> 22:01.880
It'd be great, if that'd be possible.

22:02.750 --> 22:06.930
However, the next time we meet,

22:06.930 --> 22:10.430
you, who are filled with hope, will get to know what true despair is.

22:10.430 --> 22:13.810
As the court will run crimson with your blood.

22:13.810 --> 22:16.400
And, just what are you doing?

22:16.400 --> 22:22.070
Um... Internal monologue?

22:22.070 --> 22:24.110
Oh, really?

22:24.110 --> 22:26.990
Hiratsuka Yura, skilled ventriloquist...

22:26.990 --> 22:27.900
or not...

22:27.900 --> 22:29.700
Into the black room with you!

22:29.700 --> 22:31.320
But why?!

22:31.320 --> 22:32.580
